dsh-webchat-right
=================

This package is a local fork of @jaychang1989/dsh-webchat 0.7.8
(https://github.com/jaychang1989/dsh-webchat), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The original work is Copyright its authors, including
jaychang1989 and xmuwenxiang (original dsh-web-chat).

Both halves are copied from upstream and adapted. The host half keeps the
Electron cookie snapshot that preserves the chat.deepseek.com login across
restarts, the external link route, and the window fallback; its shell
(chrome-less Edge/Chrome window) strategy and the legacy snapshot migration
were dropped, and the Electron-window strategy now falls back to the system
browser directly. The browser half moved the entry to the sidebar foot and the
page from the center column to a right-sidebar tab.

Changes from upstream (browser half only):
  - `sidebar.panellist` entry replaced by a `sidebar.footer.action` entry;
  - `main` panel replaced by a `sidebarRightTabs` type plus a
    `sidebar.right.pane.tab` body, opened with `ctx.sidebarRight.openTab`;
  - the persistent guest is now claimed per visible body, so several
    `keepMounted` tab bodies can coexist without fighting over its geometry;
  - the `main` panel remains as a fallback when no right sidebar is available.
